  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto officially designated 19 individuals as National Heroes, including his grandfather RM Margono Djojohadikusumo.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto bestowed the National Hero title upon 19 figures recognized for their historical contributions.",
    "The list includes RM Margono Djojohadikusumo, the president's grandfather and a prominent economic figure, alongside others like Hoegeng and Maraden Panggabean.",
    "Government officials stated that the president initially hesitated to approve the nomination of his own relative due to potential conflict of interest concerns."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On November 10, 2026, President Prabowo Subianto officially conferred the title of National Hero upon 19 distinguished figures in recognition of their past services to the nation. This group of honorees encompasses individuals who contributed to various sectors, including economic development and national defense. Notably, the list includes RM Margono Djojohadikusumo, the grandfather of the President and a historical figure known for his influence on Indonesia's economic landscape. According to government officials, President Subianto expressed initial reservations regarding the inclusion of his relative to avoid perceptions of personal interest, though the nomination eventually proceeded. Other notable recipients recognized during the announcement include former Police Chief Hoegeng and former Armed Forces Commander Maraden Panggabean. Various regional officials and state institutions have expressed support for these designations, noting the potential for these legacies to serve as inspiration for future generations.",
